  "body": "Privately tucked away in a peaceful setting alive with birdsong, your family will love this well renovated 1960s home. Offering you an exceptional lifestyle with lush green views stretching across the golf course to Rangitoto Island and sweeping around to Auckland's iconic city skyline, this property is a must-see.\r\nThoughtfully designed to maximise the stunning outlook, the dining area and lounge flow effortlessly onto a spacious entertaining deck – the perfect spot for family gatherings, summer barbecues or simply relaxing while soaking up the remarkable views. The welcoming lounge is centred around a cosy gas fireplace, creating a warm and inviting place to unwind. Sliding doors on either side open to a second, sheltered deck, offering a private, sunny outdoor living space where you can follow the sun throughout the day.\r\nThe home features four bedrooms and a bathroom plus there is a heat pump for year-round comfort. Beneath the home, a substantial storage area offers excellent practicality along with exciting scope to further enhance, improve, or develop to add future value.\r\nA rare opportunity to secure a tranquil family retreat that combines stunning views, everyday convenience and exciting potential for the future. It comes to the market with genuine motivation from our vendors. \r\nThe location is outstanding. Enjoy the convenience of being moments from Narrow Neck Beach, excellent schools, the Devonport ferry for an effortless city commute and the vibrant heart of Devonport Village with its boutique shopping, cafés, cinema, parks, and supermarket.\r\nA home you will love to come home to with its views, privacy, sunshine, family appeal and future potential.\r\nDon't miss your chance to secure this charming bungalow. Contact us today to arrange your viewing and experience the magic for yourself before someone else does.",
